  "aboutWhatIsItTitle": "What this is",
  "aboutWhatIsItBody": "Polaris is a free investing trainer for people who have never bought a stock before. A virtual $10,000 portfolio, simulated market prices, dividends on a real calendar, and an AI mentor, Cosmo, who explains everything in plain words — no rush, no \"casino\" pressure.",
  "aboutSimNoteTitle": "This is learning, not a stock exchange",
  "aboutSimNoteBody": "This is a simulator: the money in your portfolio is virtual, the app never places real trades. The \"Ready for real investing?\" section under More is an honest handoff to EU-licensed brokers, for whenever you decide to invest for real.",
  "aboutMascotTitle": "Cosmo",
  "aboutMascotBody": "Your astronaut mentor. Cosmo doesn't give personal investment recommendations or promise returns — just calmly explains what's happening in the market and in your portfolio.",
  "aboutDataTitle": "Where the data comes from",
  "aboutDataBody": "Prices and charts are generated by Polaris's own server: they behave like a real market, but they are simulated and are not exchange data. The app does not use any third-party market feed.",
  "aboutThanksTitle": "Credits",
  "aboutAttrCoinGecko": "Powered by CoinGecko",
  "aboutAttrCurrency": "Exchange rates: open.er-api.com",
  "aboutAttrCrypto": "Crypto tickers: Binance public API",
  "aboutAttrStocks": "Stock quotes: Yahoo Finance (may be delayed)",

  "brokersTitle": "Ready for real investing?",
  "brokersRiskTop": "Investing carries the risk of losing capital. Nothing below is financial advice or a personal recommendation: Polaris is not a licensed financial advisor. Before investing real money, study the terms and risks with your chosen broker yourself.",
  "brokersRiskBottom": "The list below is informational and shown in alphabetical order, not as a recommendation. We don't get paid for which broker you choose (phase 1). The decision is yours alone.",
  "brokersIntro": "You've practiced in Polaris with a virtual $10,000 and real live prices — a safe way to understand how it all works, with no risk to your wallet. Once you feel ready to invest real money, here are a few EU-licensed stock brokers — beginners usually find them easier to start with.",
  "brokersSectionListTitle": "EU-licensed stock and ETF brokers",
  "brokersExternalSiteNote": "external site",
  "brokersOpenFailed": "Couldn't open the link on this device",
  "brokersOpenSiteLabel": "Open website",
  "brokersNoCryptoNote": "No crypto brokers or exchanges here — only regulated brokers for real stocks and ETFs.",
  "brokersEtoroDesc": "A broker with a simple mobile app and ready-made portfolio picks; regulated in the EU (Cyprus/Malta).",
  "brokersIbkrDesc": "One of the largest brokers in the world, a huge range of markets; better suited to those ready to dig into a more detailed interface.",
  "brokersLightyearDesc": "A young European broker with an honest interface and \"why the price changed\" explanations — closest in spirit to Polaris.",
  "brokersScalableDesc": "A German neobroker with fractional shares and ready-made savings plans; regulated by BaFin (Germany).",
  "brokersTraderepublicDesc": "A German neobroker-bank with a simple app and low fees; regulated as a bank in the EU.",
  "brokersXtbDesc": "A Polish broker with free stocks/ETFs up to a certain turnover and educational materials for beginners; licensed in the EU.",

  "legalTitle": "Legal information",
  "legalIntro": "In plain words about what Polaris can and can't do — no fine print.",
  "legalSimTitle": "Educational simulator",
  "legalSimBody": "Polaris is an educational app. The portfolio, trades and money in it are virtual: the app does not and cannot make real purchases of stocks, ETFs or anything else.",
  "legalNoAdviceTitle": "Not investment advice",
  "legalNoAdviceBody": "Nothing in the app — not the numbers, not Cosmo's comments, not the theme picks — is a personal investment recommendation, advice, or an offer to buy/sell a specific instrument. Polaris is not a licensed financial advisor and not a bank.",
  "legalPastResultsTitle": "Past performance doesn't guarantee the future",
  "legalPastResultsBody": "An asset's growth in the past (in the app or in real life) doesn't guarantee it will keep growing. Any investment can rise or fall in value, up to a complete loss of the money invested.",
  "legalDelayedDataTitle": "Data may be delayed",
  "legalDelayedDataBody": "Some quotes (non-US stocks, some securities) are updated not in real time but at end of trading day — such assets are honestly marked \"EOD\"/\"delayed\" in the catalog. Even \"live\" prices carry the usual small delay of free data sources.",
  "legalAiTitle": "AI mentor Cosmo is not an advisor",
  "legalAiBody": "Cosmo explains terms and comments on your practice trades in plain language, but doesn't pick specific securities for your situation and doesn't promise returns. Cosmo's answers can be inaccurate — like any AI — and don't replace consulting a licensed professional.",
  "legalEntityTitle": "Who makes Polaris",
  "legalEntityBody": "At the simulator stage, Polaris is a non-commercial educational project, without a banking or brokerage license and without collecting users' real money. Legal entity information will be published here once real trading launches at the next stage.",

  "privacyTitle": "Privacy",
  "privacyIntro": "In short: Polaris has no account, no name or email of yours, and doesn't sell data to advertisers. Below is exactly what happens with your data.",
  "privacyLocalTitle": "Stored on your device",
  "privacyLocalBody": "Your portfolio, lesson progress, streak and settings are stored right on your phone or computer. There's no account or sign-in — you play as a guest right away. You can erase everything by simply deleting the app.",
  "privacyServerTitle": "Sent to the server",
  "privacyServerBody": "Only this is sent to the Polaris server: (1) anonymous quote requests (ticker only, not tied to you) and (2) the text of your questions to Cosmo, along with an anonymized portfolio snapshot (tickers and shares, no name or device info). Personal data — name, email, phone number, location — is never collected or sent anywhere by the app.",
  "privacyNoTrackersTitle": "No third-party trackers",
  "privacyNoTrackersBody": "No ad SDKs, no third-party behavioral trackers, no data sale. Anonymous usage stats (which lessons are taken more often) exist only to improve the learning program — never used for personal investment recommendations (that's the EU legal boundary).",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "Your rights (GDPR)",
  "privacyRightsBody": "Since data never leaves your device and there's no account, you can delete it yourself at any moment: reset the portfolio in settings, or delete the app entirely to erase everything. There's no need to separately request data deletion from us — there's simply nothing on a server.",
  "privacyFullPolicyLabel": "Full privacy policy",
  "privacyFullPolicyNote": "opens on our website",

